    {
      "subId": "7180902",
      "subQuestName": "在南码头附近寻找诗歌灵感",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "718090201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "718090201": {
            "id": "718090201",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "浩仔",
            "text": "还好，还好…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718090202"
            ]
          },
          "718090202": {
            "id": "718090202",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "什么还好？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718090203"
            ]
          },
          "718090203": {
            "id": "718090203",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "浩仔",
            "text": "哦，是旅行者啊。之前城里不是出了那么大的事吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718090204"
            ]
          },
          "718090204": {
            "id": "718090204",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "浩仔",
            "text": "还好，那件事之后也没出什么大乱子。最主要的是…城里的饭馆也都开得好好的。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718090205"
            ]
          },
          "718090205": {
            "id": "718090205",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "浩仔",
            "text": "要不然，那么多好菜我都吃不着了…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718090206"
            ]
          },
          "718090206": {
            "id": "718090206",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "原来是因为吃的啊…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718090207"
            ]
          },
          "718090207": {
            "id": "718090207",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "浩仔",
            "text": "你可别小看了吃啊。要判断一个地方的好坏，最直接的方法，就是看这地方吃的东西怎么样。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718090208"
            ]
          },
          "718090208": {
            "id": "718090208",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "浩仔",
            "text": "啊…说着说着肚子又饿了，我得再去吃点什么…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7180903",
      "subQuestName": "在「不卜庐」附近寻找诗歌灵感",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "718090301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "718090301": {
            "id": "718090301",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "范二爷",
            "text": "现在这戏啊，我真是越听越不明白…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718090302"
            ]
          },
          "718090302": {
            "id": "718090302",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "怎么了？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718090303"
            ]
          },
          "718090303": {
            "id": "718090303",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "范二爷",
            "text": "是旅行者啊，这「和裕茶馆」又有几出新戏。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718090304"
            ]
          },
          "718090304": {
            "id": "718090304",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "范二爷",
            "text": "不过这些新戏啊…热闹倒是热闹，但我都有些听不懂了，年轻人倒是都很喜欢。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718090305"
            ]
          },
          "718090305": {
            "id": "718090305",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "您觉得这样好吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718090306"
            ]
          },
          "718090306": {
            "id": "718090306",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "范二爷",
            "text": "这个嘛…就我来说，当然是乐意听那些老戏的，这么多年也听习惯了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718090307"
            ]
          },
          "718090307": {
            "id": "718090307",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "范二爷",
            "text": "但是，现在整座璃月港都在变，变几场新戏出来倒也应景。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718090308"
            ]
          },
          "718090308": {
            "id": "718090308",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "范二爷",
            "text": "唉，但这变化也太快了，老戏也好久没开，也不知道岩王爷他…算了，不说了，不说了。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7180904",
      "subQuestName": "在玉京台附近寻找诗歌灵感",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "718090401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "718090401": {
            "id": "718090401",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "清昼",
            "text": "您可有收获？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718090402"
            ]
          },
          "718090402": {
            "id": "718090402",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "有不少。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718090403"
            ]
          },
          "718090403": {
            "id": "718090403",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "清昼",
            "text": "哦？请说来听听。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718090404"
            ]
          },
          "718090404": {
            "id": "718090404",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "南码头上有很多狗。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718090405"
            ]
          },
          "718090405": {
            "id": "718090405",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "清昼",
            "text": "哦，不错不错，颇有生活气息。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718090406"
            ]
          },
          "718090406": {
            "id": "718090406",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "「不卜庐」附近有很多团雀。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718090407"
            ]
          },
          "718090407": {
            "id": "718090407",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "清昼",
            "text": "团雀，唔…也能算是宁和之象，入诗正好。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718090408"
            ]
          },
          "718090408": {
            "id": "718090408",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "有人只在意吃…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718090409"
            ]
          },
          "718090409": {
            "id": "718090409",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "清昼",
            "text": "这样也没错，吃当然是头等要务，特别…是在这座璃月港里。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718090410"
            ]
          },
          "718090410": {
            "id": "718090410",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "清昼",
            "text": "这倒也有些趣味，我先记下，说不定也能入诗。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718090411"
            ]
          },
          "718090411": {
            "id": "718090411",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "有人觉得变化太快。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718090412"
            ]
          },
          "718090412": {
            "id": "718090412",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "清昼",
            "text": "嗯…有人这么觉得倒也正常，如今的璃月港里的变化可以称得上是日新月异，有些东西就连我都有点接受不了…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718090413"
            ]
          },
          "718090413": {
            "id": "718090413",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "清昼",
            "text": "但这题目有些太大，只怕一首诗容纳不下…我还是先记下吧。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718090414"
            ]
          },
          "718090414": {
            "id": "718090414",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "清昼",
            "text": "这样就可以了，拜托你帮忙果然不错。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718090415"
            ]
          },
          "718090415": {
            "id": "718090415",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "清昼",
            "text": "如此一来，我的下一部诗集中说不定又可以添几首新作。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718090416"
            ]
          },
          "718090416": {
            "id": "718090416",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "清昼",
            "text": "啊对了，除了一些财帛俗物外…还有一份小小心意，还请收下。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718090417"
            ]
          },
          "718090417": {
            "id": "718090417",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "清昼",
            "text": "等我的下一本诗集出版，便可以凭此签名换得一册。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
